This folder contains all pertinent model runs and comparison graphics as used for the CIE review and described in the varios CIE documents.

The final SAFE assessment models are provided in the '_Final_Mods' folder.

The other folders contain the various models developed as part of the model building excercises or that were presented as sensitivity runs. 

The '1Reg_Mods' folder contains the single region models, including the results of both the single change (1-off) and stepwise model building from Model 25.12_1Reg_Cont to Model 26.1_1Reg.

The 'FAA_Mods' folder contains the Fleets-as-Areas (FAA) models, including Model 26.2_FAA.

The 'Spat_Mods' folder contains the final spatial models, including Model 26.3_5reg_Spat and Model 26.3a_3Reg_Spat.


